    "reviews": "\u201cIt\u2019s almost like magic with how drastically the narrative can change just by swapping a single word here or there\u201d<br>***** \u2013 TouchArcade<br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s eerie, creepy, and is all the better when used with headphones under a blanket with the lights off\u201d<br>recommended \u2013 TapSmart<br><br>\u201cThe scale is inebriating, feeding a compulsion to see just how many invisible junction points connect one character's reality to another's\u201d<br>featured \u2013 Eurogamer<br>",
